    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Your Centre of Expertise (CoE) will confirm in agreement with your organisation whether your organisation will undertake:",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "an existing Full, Medium or Lite PCIP assessment or",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "an abbreviated assessment option (a Pulse Check or a Pulse Check Lite assessment)",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Assessment selection is based on several factors e.g.:",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "organisation spend",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "whether the organisation has undertaken a PCIP assessment before",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "size of the organisation",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "market factors",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The table below offers a guide on which type of review an organisation could receive:",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "table",
      "text": "£2m > Total Spend < £15m\t£15m > Total Spend < £40-60m\tTotal Spend > £40-60m\nLite Assessment\tMedium Assessment\tFull Assessment",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {
        "rows": [
          [
            "£2m > Total Spend < £15m",
            "£15m > Total Spend < £40-60m",
            "Total Spend > £40-60m"
          ],
          [
            "Lite Assessment",
            "Medium Assessment",
            "Full Assessment"
          ]
        ],
        "row_count": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Please note this is guidance only.",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "A copy of the differing PCIP assessment questions can be found at the bottom of this page.",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The Evaluation Matrix gives examples of the types of evidence that can be used by organisations to respond to the PCIP assessment questions - please note this is not an exhaustive list and is for guidance only.",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
